Description:
 verify-iso-sig - verify the GPG signature of a downloaded ISO image
Changes:
 verify-iso-sig (2026.08.04) mx; urgency=medium
 .
   * Make GUI verification interruptible (AdrianTM).
   * Fix progress bar not animating (AdrianTM).
   * Infer checksum-listing hash algorithm from digest length (AdrianTM).
   * Recognize more algorithms/tags/digest lengths.
   * Accept an ISO plus its checksum/signature files as explicit
     arguments (two or three files), from the command line, a file
     manager's "Open With" right-click menu, or drag-and-drop.
   * Manage Trusted Keys offers "Import from File" directly when no
     keys are saved yet.
